  lines:
  - "I just didn\u2019t think you had it in you. "
  - <?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> Did you watch the show with your eyes closed?!
  - "More like, you\u2019ve seen just as many as I have and this is a first"
  - "<?BowleyStartShaking=15,15,1> Well MAYBE it\u2019s because this is the ONE "
  - "Ah I see what you\u2019re doing, it won\u2019t be THAT easy to convince me"
